# Console screenshots embedded in README.md are LFS-tracked: the HuggingFace
# Space deploy path rejects a push containing non-LFS binaries, and these are
# the only new PNGs added since the last `git lfs track "*.png"`.
#
# Scoped to this directory on purpose — a global `*.png` rule here would
# retroactively re-point the already-committed web/public/logos/*.png blobs.
docs/assets/shots/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
